2594
02:18:01,690 --> 02:18:02,490
On stilts.

2595
02:18:10,800 --> 02:18:11,400
You know what?

2596
02:18:11,420 --> 02:18:11,800
You can...

2597
02:18:11,800 --> 02:18:12,280
I'm sorry.

2598
02:18:12,620 --> 02:18:13,080
You can keep it.

2599
02:18:14,480 --> 02:18:15,400
