2613
02:18:47,930 --> 02:18:48,890
Clean slice.

2614
02:18:49,770 --> 02:18:51,690
But I do it with a boat and an axe.

2615
02:18:52,490 --> 02:18:53,370
Clean slice.

2616
02:18:53,690 --> 02:18:54,410
Right through.

2617
02:19:03,680 --> 02:19:04,200
Awkward.

2618
02:19:05,600 --> 02:19:08,000
I was trying to see who would look away first.

2619
02:19:08,280 --> 02:19:08,860
He won.

2620
02:19:09,120 --> 02:19:10,160
I couldn't do it anymore.

2621
02:19:13,250 --> 02:19:14,670
Give me your food.

2622
02:19:24,060 --> 02:19:24,860
Oh my god!

2623
02:19:25,040 --> 02:19:25,640
