2631
02:20:14,150 --> 02:20:14,670
Oh, wait.

2632
02:20:14,750 --> 02:20:15,130
I see more.

2633
02:20:19,730 --> 02:20:20,730
Gotta get that beef.

2634
02:20:23,430 --> 02:20:24,890
Probably the best food in the game.

2635
02:20:30,930 --> 02:20:32,270
Like, you can sprint for days.

2636
