2672
02:23:17,170 --> 02:23:17,870
Oh, wait.

2673
02:23:21,920 --> 02:23:22,400
No.

2674
02:23:22,880 --> 02:23:23,120
Nope.

2675
02:23:23,760 --> 02:23:24,340
Don't do it.

2676
02:23:24,340 --> 02:23:25,240
Do not.

2677
02:23:27,440 --> 02:23:28,800
Let's go up here and take a look around.

2678
02:23:28,920 --> 02:23:31,060
I want to see what's happening in a 360.

2679
02:23:44,150 --> 02:23:45,370
We get to watch the sunset.

2680
02:23:48,760 --> 02:23:49,440
