2691
02:24:24,540 --> 02:24:26,100
Look at this place!

2692
02:24:28,240 --> 02:24:29,540
That's incredible.

2693
02:24:32,160 --> 02:24:33,360
Very nice.

2694
02:24:39,120 --> 02:24:40,560
Let's see what's down here.

2695
02:24:46,960 --> 02:24:50,080
This is the ideal place to build something great.

2696
02:24:50,080 --> 02:24:51,080
Oh, shit.

2697
02:24:51,320 --> 02:24:52,120
Oh, shit.

2698
02:24:52,360 --> 02:24:52,700
Oh, shit.

2699
02:24:52,880 --> 02:24:53,500
Don't blow up on me.

2700
02:24:57,860 --> 02:24:58,240
