2748
02:27:39,610 --> 02:27:41,670
Like the valley we had in here, and then this...

2749
02:27:44,590 --> 02:27:45,370
Super cool.

2750
02:27:46,910 --> 02:27:49,630
I think that's lava over there that's producing light.

2751
02:27:49,770 --> 02:27:50,050
Oh, God.

2752
02:27:50,510 --> 02:27:50,970
Oh, God.

2753
02:27:58,670 --> 02:28:00,830
