2783
02:29:50,050 --> 02:29:51,510
I'm kind of glad we didn't go through the nether.

2784
02:29:52,770 --> 02:29:53,350
I take it all back.

2785
02:29:53,450 --> 02:29:53,950
This is great.

2786
02:29:57,260 --> 02:29:57,580
No!

2787
02:30:00,000 --> 02:30:00,680
Get out of here.

2788
02:30:02,680 --> 02:30:03,980
Don't even want to explore the village.

2789
02:30:04,140 --> 02:30:04,760
I want to see what's in here.

2790
02:30:07,790 --> 02:30:08,610
Oh my god.

2791
02:30:09,210 --> 02:30:09,710
