2792
02:30:13,950 --> 02:30:17,130
Eh, I don't see anything particularly cool from here.

2793
02:30:18,310 --> 02:30:18,930
But you know what?

2794
02:30:19,090 --> 02:30:19,530
We could...

2795
02:30:19,530 --> 02:30:19,790
Nah.

2796
02:30:20,330 --> 02:30:20,490
Nah.

2797
02:30:21,510 --> 02:30:22,370
The thing is...

2798
