2805
02:30:32,170 --> 02:30:32,870
Holy shit.

2806
02:30:35,450 --> 02:30:35,790
Nice.

2807
02:30:36,410 --> 02:30:37,870
Man, the bow is slapping.

2808
02:30:39,070 --> 02:30:40,170
This bow is so good.

2809
