2819
02:31:14,920 --> 02:31:16,300
Oh yeah, look at that.

2820
02:31:17,240 --> 02:31:18,360
Gunpowder en masse.

2821
02:31:22,820 --> 02:31:23,400
Oh my god.

2822
02:31:23,500 --> 02:31:23,920
This bow...

2823
02:31:23,920 --> 02:31:25,260
