2824
02:31:32,430 --> 02:31:33,730
But then sometimes they don't.

2825
02:31:33,790 --> 02:31:34,530
It's interesting.

2826
02:31:40,600 --> 02:31:41,080
Whoa!

2827
02:31:42,260 --> 02:31:42,700
Uh-oh.

2828
02:31:43,000 --> 02:31:43,480
Uh-oh.

2829
02:31:44,660 --> 02:31:45,700
Ah, we may be in trouble.

2830
02:31:47,260 --> 02:31:48,640
I just need to aim better than them.

2831
02:31:49,220 --> 02:31:50,100
Where the hell did you come from?

2832
02:31:51,220 --> 02:31:51,640
Okay, eat.

2833
02:31:57,110 --> 02:31:57,690
Stop it.

2834
