03:06:39,420 --> 03:06:40,000
I double dare you.

3413
03:06:41,140 --> 03:06:42,280
There's also one over there.

3414
03:06:46,640 --> 03:06:47,120
Yes!

3415
03:06:54,850 --> 03:06:56,190
Alright, there's one over there now.

3416
03:06:56,970 --> 03:06:59,150
Why are they not spawning that frequently anymore?

3417
03:06:59,750 --> 03:07:01,850
I feel like spawners usually have them in...

3418
03:07:02,410 --> 03:07:03,590
troves all the time.

3419
03:07:09,190 --> 03:07:09,770
Come on.

3420
03:07:11,130 --> 03:07:13,430
In fact, while that's doing that, I kinda wanna take a look around.

3421
03:07:16,150 --> 03:07:17,110
What am I seeing?

3422
03:07:34,340 --> 03:07:35,280
Get rid of that.

3423
03:07:44,760 --> 03:07:45,920
Hand over your rods!

3424
03:07:49,100 --> 03:07:49,900
Enderman up there.

3425
03:07:50,500 --> 03:07:51,280
What is this I'm seeing?

3426
03:07:51,400 --> 03:07:51,920
Oh, okay, nevermind.

3427
03:07:53,000 --> 03:07:54,120
Thought I saw...

3428
03:07:54,680 --> 03:07:55,960
Why is that portal not on?

3429
03:08:01,340 --> 03:08:02,140
Alright, that's fine.

3430
03:08:02,620 --> 03:08:03,320
All I needed.

3431
03:08:04,680 --> 03:08:05,420
No more!

3432
03:08:16,900 --> 03:08:18,040
Who needs a shield anyway?

3433
03:08:18,440 --> 03:08:19,060
Not me.

3434
03:08:19,980 --> 03:08:21,020
Not when I have bows.

3435
03:08:25,510 --> 03:08:27,470
Ooh, I do need to kill these.

3436
03:08:30,420 --> 03:08:32,000
I'm wondering about this over here.

3437
03:08:33,820 --> 03:08:36,020
Like, what is going on with...

3438
03:08:36,020 --> 03:08:37,400
I kinda wanna explore that a little bit.

3439
03:08:38,260 --> 03:08:39,500
I feel like that's mysterious.

3440
03:08:52,220 --> 03:08:53,200
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

3441
03:08:53,280 --> 03:08:54,140
We can go down here.

3442
03:08:56,240 --> 03:08:57,000
Oh, yeah.

3443
03:08:58,020 --> 03:08:58,740
That's better.

3444
03:09:00,360 --> 03:09:01,860
Kinda regret the shield thing now.

3445
03:09:17,950 --> 03:09:18,850
I changed my mind.

3446
03:09:19,510 --> 03:09:20,310
We're shielding.

3447
03:09:24,270 --> 03:09:25,030
My goodness.

3448
03:09:35,300 --> 03:09:36,240
Oh, hello.

3449
03:09:38,100 --> 03:09:38,920
Look at you.

3450
03:09:39,060 --> 03:09:39,440
You're caught.

3451
03:09:44,820 --> 03:09:46,320
Like, what the hell is this even?

3452
03:09:46,480 --> 03:09:47,160
Why is this...

3453
03:09:47,160 --> 03:09:47,720
Like this?

3454
03:09:49,260 --> 03:09:49,880
What's that?

3455
03:09:53,240 --> 03:09:53,680
What?

3456
03:09:54,260 --> 03:09:55,060
There's more here.

3457
03:09:55,120 --> 03:09:55,440
Look at this.

3458
03:09:58,060 --> 03:09:58,580
Oh.

3459
03:09:58,820 --> 03:09:59,200
Oh.

3460
03:09:59,200 --> 03:09:59,660
I'm withering.

3461
03:10:03,840 --> 03:10:04,960
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

3462
03:10:05,460 --> 03:10:05,940
Oh!

3463
03:10:06,700 --> 03:10:07,220
Shit!

3464
03:10:07,660 --> 03:10:08,980
Good thing I'm fire immune.

3465
03:10:10,820 --> 03:10:11,740
Oh, my God.

3466
03:10:12,500 --> 03:10:13,540
Otherwise, this would've been the end.

3467
03:10:15,560 --> 03:10:16,240
Burn it.

3468
03:10:19,040 --> 03:10:20,440
Three minutes fire immune still.

3469
03:10:20,700 --> 03:10:21,160
That's good.

3470
03:10:27,280 --> 03:10:28,720
What the hell is happening here?

3471
03:10:33,000 --> 03:10:33,520
Lava!

3472
03:10:33,520 --> 03:10:34,800
A lot of it.

3473
03:10:36,100 --> 03:10:37,120
A lot of...

3474
03:10:37,120 --> 03:10:37,880
A lot of lava.

3475
03:10:44,960 --> 03:10:45,800
Let me ascend.

3476
03:10:58,760 --> 03:10:59,880
I do need experience.

3477
03:11:00,380 --> 03:11:01,800
Should be mining some quartz on the way.

3478
03:11:13,850 --> 03:11:15,370
Why am I not getting any experience?

3479
03:11:16,450 --> 03:11:18,270
My pickaxe is not even absorbing it.

3480
03:11:19,590 --> 03:11:20,850
Oh, I get it.

3481
03:11:20,990 --> 03:11:21,630
I get it.

3482
03:11:22,050 --> 03:11:23,410
We're using silk touch.

3483
03:11:24,710 --> 03:11:25,190
Whoops.

3484
03:11:26,950 --> 03:11:29,130
Oh, and we got some new recipes out of that.

3485
03:11:31,270 --> 03:11:33,010
That just bamboozled me so much.

3486
03:11:34,130 --> 03:11:35,110
There we go.

3487
03:11:37,990 --> 03:11:39,150
That was so weird.

3488
03:11:43,100 --> 03:11:45,100
Man, this fortress is massive.

3489
03:11:50,680 --> 03:11:51,720
What the...

3490
03:11:59,380 --> 03:12:01,340
How did I not hit that one, huh?

3491
03:12:08,470 --> 03:12:09,870
I... I love the nether.

3492
03:12:14,300 --> 03:12:15,820
These guys wanna dance, it seems.

3493
03:12:23,090 --> 03:12:23,910
Oh, my God.

3494
03:12:24,150 --> 03:12:24,630
Come on.

3495
03:12:25,270 --> 03:12:25,970
There we go.

3496
03:12:29,840 --> 03:12:30,460
Good.

3497
03:12:39,370 --> 03:12:40,690
Some lovely music now.

3498
03:12:48,980 --> 03:12:49,840
What do we got here?

3499
03:12:50,960 --> 03:12:51,500
Oh, God.

3500
03:13:00,580 --> 03:13:01,200
Good.

3501
03:13:06,940 --> 03:13:10,420
This is a completely new part of the nether.

3502
03:13:12,840 --> 03:13:14,660
Which doesn't sound that crazy, but...

3503
03:13:14,660 --> 03:13:15,240
For me, it is.

3504
03:13:15,320 --> 03:13:16,400
Because I always sort of...

3505
03:13:16,400 --> 03:13:17,960
Stick to the same region in the nether.

3506
03:13:23,370 --> 03:13:23,810
Um...

3507
03:13:24,370 --> 03:13:26,290
Fuck, I really need ascension blocks here.

3508
03:13:28,010 --> 03:13:29,910
I wanna go over there and mine some netherrack.

3509
03:13:31,870 --> 03:13:32,310
Yeah.

3510
03:13:40,040 --> 03:13:40,900
This looks good.

3511
03:13:44,510 --> 03:13:45,270
Let's just mine...

3512
03:13:46,050 --> 03:13:47,370
A certain direction here.

3513
03:13:49,450 --> 03:13:50,650
And throw away some stuff.

3514
03:13:51,250 --> 03:13:52,290
In fact, I'm gonna, uh...

3515
03:13:52,290 --> 03:13:53,230
Drink...

3516
03:13:53,890 --> 03:13:54,670
One of these.

3517
03:13:56,970 --> 03:13:57,370
Pop.

3518
03:13:57,850 --> 03:13:59,230
Give myself some, uh...

3519
03:13:59,230 --> 03:13:59,690
Swiftness.

3520
03:14:00,190 --> 03:14:00,950
Night vision.

3521
03:14:02,090 --> 03:14:02,790
Yes, sir.

3522
03:14:05,210 --> 03:14:05,690
Cool.

3523
03:14:05,870 --> 03:14:06,190
Let's go.

3524
03:14:07,150 --> 03:14:08,390
I'm gonna be swiftly...

3525
03:14:08,390 --> 03:14:09,490
Wait, I wonder if this also...

3526
03:14:09,490 --> 03:14:10,630
Gives me mining speed.

3527
03:14:11,750 --> 03:14:12,910
Nah, no way, right?

3528
03:14:15,050 --> 03:14:16,150
No, it doesn't.

3529
03:14:24,900 --> 03:14:26,040
Hopefully nobody got angry there.

3530
03:14:32,040 --> 03:14:32,880
Let's go up a bit.

3531
03:14:40,230 --> 03:14:40,890
Oh, god.

3532
03:14:42,810 --> 03:14:43,830
I hate this place.

3533
03:15:02,740 --> 03:15:03,680
What will I find?

3534
03:15:06,540 --> 03:15:08,000
Just take me out into the open, please.

3535
03:15:15,280 --> 03:15:15,640
Pchomp!

3536
03:15:16,420 --> 03:15:16,940
That's lava.

3537
03:15:22,550 --> 03:15:22,910
Fuck.

3538
03:15:23,250 --> 03:15:24,390
Can we not have this stone here?

3539
03:15:24,490 --> 03:15:24,810
I want...

3540
03:15:24,810 --> 03:15:25,670
Yeah, this is what I need.

3541
03:15:29,270 --> 03:15:30,330
Oh, my god.

3542
03:15:31,030 --> 03:15:31,050
Oh, my god.

3543
03:15:31,050 --> 03:15:33,970
My pulse just instantly went to 300.

3544
03:15:35,470 --> 03:15:37,130
Imagine I fell into lava there.

3545
03:15:38,430 --> 03:15:39,430
I need to be careful.

3546
03:15:48,960 --> 03:15:49,680
Oh, yeah.

3547
03:15:49,840 --> 03:15:50,520
Let's put it up.

3548
03:15:51,580 --> 03:15:52,060
No!

3549
03:15:58,100 --> 03:16:02,780
I want to make a boat out of obsidian and then sail on the lava with it.

3550
03:16:04,700 --> 03:16:05,520
Oh, finally.

3551
03:16:06,980 --> 03:16:09,180
Okay, but this area is kind of annoying.

3552
03:16:12,240 --> 03:16:13,460
This biome right here?

3553
03:16:14,260 --> 03:16:14,740
Terrible.

3554
03:16:15,000 --> 03:16:15,520
I hate it.

3555
03:16:16,720 --> 03:16:20,380
It looks cool, but it's a goddamn headache to traverse.

3556
03:16:32,110 --> 03:16:33,070
Actually, let me go up.

3557
03:16:33,150 --> 03:16:34,370
It seems like there's netherrack there.

3558
03:16:41,030 --> 03:16:41,490
Nice.

3559
03:16:42,710 --> 03:16:43,630
Experience for moi.

3560
03:16:52,400 --> 03:16:53,280
I hear enemies.

3561
03:16:53,300 --> 03:16:54,660
That means I'm close to the surface.

3562
03:16:57,800 --> 03:16:58,260
Maybe...

3563
03:16:58,260 --> 03:16:59,220
Oh, it's actually to the right.

3564
03:17:09,480 --> 03:17:10,460
I'm hearing lava.

3565
03:17:20,420 --> 03:17:25,060
Maybe it is a mistake to dig through mountains in the nether.

3566
03:17:25,920 --> 03:17:27,100
You can be in here forever.

3567
03:17:28,260 --> 03:17:29,120
If you're not careful.

3568
03:17:32,500 --> 03:17:34,460
I mean, at some point I gotta emerge somewhere, right?

3569
03:17:49,540 --> 03:17:50,380
Oh, weird.

3570
03:17:53,080 --> 03:17:53,700
Here we go.

3571
03:17:54,060 --> 03:17:54,420
Kinda.

3572
03:18:03,290 --> 03:18:06,710
Honestly, I'm back in the mode of not wanting to give a fuck about quartz.

3573
03:18:06,890 --> 03:18:07,790
I have so much at home.

3574
03:18:08,810 --> 03:18:10,090
And I don't have the space for it.

3575
03:18:10,150 --> 03:18:11,230
We're gonna ignore quartz now.

3576
03:18:12,270 --> 03:18:13,450
Only do it for the experience.

3577
03:18:14,990 --> 03:18:15,390
Alright.

3578
03:18:15,590 --> 03:18:17,150
It's time for SLJ to make an appearance.

3579
03:18:18,550 --> 03:18:19,430
Alright, SLJ.

3580
03:18:19,530 --> 03:18:21,730
If you're in the chat right now, I want you to say something.

3581
03:18:24,850 --> 03:18:26,330
And I'll know whether or not you're there.

3582
03:18:27,670 --> 03:18:28,910
Because I'm reading chat today.

3583
03:18:32,260 --> 03:18:33,360
Hmm, he's not there.

3584
03:18:35,700 --> 03:18:37,740
Looks like SLJ is not present today.

3585
03:18:50,600 --> 03:18:51,700
Dude, look at this place!

3586
03:18:53,960 --> 03:18:55,180
Doesn't this look alien?

3587
03:18:55,300 --> 03:18:56,000
Holy crap!

3588
03:19:12,750 --> 03:19:13,670
Oh, wait a minute.

3589
03:19:14,270 --> 03:19:14,850
What is over here?

3590
03:19:31,070 --> 03:19:31,850
Jumping master.

3591
03:19:32,370 --> 03:19:33,170
Strikes again!

3592
03:19:36,360 --> 03:19:36,900
Oh!

3593
03:19:37,160 --> 03:19:38,200
Another fortress?

3594
03:19:38,820 --> 03:19:39,520
What is it?

3595
03:19:39,660 --> 03:19:40,160
Man...

3596
03:19:40,160 --> 03:19:42,640
I guess the Nether is just littered with these, huh?

3597
03:19:43,360 --> 03:19:44,500
It's a common occurrence.

3598
03:19:45,740 --> 03:19:47,020
Nothing special about it.

3599
03:19:58,980 --> 03:20:00,000
Ah, there you are.

3600
03:20:01,840 --> 03:20:02,580
One hit.

3601
03:20:12,460 --> 03:20:13,300
Let's check it out.

3602
03:20:16,680 --> 03:20:17,600
I'm home!

3603
03:20:21,100 --> 03:20:21,580
Well...

3604
03:20:22,060 --> 03:20:23,440
Not really, but...

3605
03:20:23,440 --> 03:20:25,400
It feels like home whenever I'm in a fortress.

3606
03:20:26,780 --> 03:20:28,200
Fortress continues over there.

3607
03:20:32,770 --> 03:20:33,250
Okay.

3608
03:20:35,250 --> 03:20:36,170
Let's have a Gander.

3609
03:20:40,170 --> 03:20:42,170
Man, this is what I love about Minecraft.

3610
03:20:42,350 --> 03:20:43,770
You know, you never know where you're gonna get, man.

3611
03:20:45,350 --> 03:20:45,670
Obsidian?

3612
03:20:45,990 --> 03:20:46,510
Yes, sir.

3613
03:20:46,610 --> 03:20:47,150
I'll take that.

3614
03:20:48,590 --> 03:20:48,910
Whoop!

3615
03:20:57,100 --> 03:20:58,140
No, no, no, no, no, no.

3616
03:21:10,650 --> 03:21:10,970
Easy!

3617
03:21:12,290 --> 03:21:13,390
Look at me slaying.

3618
03:21:17,680 --> 03:21:18,540
Got some gold.

3619
03:21:18,800 --> 03:21:19,080
You know what?

3620
03:21:19,100 --> 03:21:19,380
Why not?

3621
03:21:19,400 --> 03:21:20,260
We can give it to the pigs.

3622
03:21:21,600 --> 03:21:23,860
I forgot to put my book back into the chest.

3623
03:21:29,800 --> 03:21:30,720
Oh, it's just a child.

3624
03:21:31,560 --> 03:21:32,400
It's just a child.

3625
03:21:33,620 --> 03:21:33,940
Fine.

3626
03:21:34,100 --> 03:21:34,540
I don't need this.

3627
03:21:34,540 --> 03:21:35,300
Uh, gunpowder?

3628
03:21:35,340 --> 03:21:36,000
I do need that.

3629
03:21:37,020 --> 03:21:37,860
Don't need this.

3630
03:21:38,080 --> 03:21:38,860
Don't need that.

3631
03:21:39,640 --> 03:21:40,320
Ah, you know what?

3632
03:21:40,320 --> 03:21:40,800
Fuck the gold.

3633
03:21:40,940 --> 03:21:42,180
It's just gonna take up inventory space.

3634
03:21:42,440 --> 03:21:43,680
And honestly, this potion?

3635
03:21:44,640 --> 03:21:45,520
Don't want it on me.

3636
03:21:46,460 --> 03:21:47,680
It's taking up space.

3637
03:21:47,900 --> 03:21:48,960
I knew I was gonna hate it.

3638
03:21:49,060 --> 03:21:49,640
Soul soil?

3639
03:21:49,840 --> 03:21:50,380
In you go.

3640
03:21:51,320 --> 03:21:52,520
Yeah, nether quartz too.

3641
03:21:52,680 --> 03:21:53,240
You go in.

3642
03:21:54,100 --> 03:21:55,000
It is what it is.

3643
03:21:57,420 --> 03:21:58,680
I kinda need this.

3644
03:22:00,340 --> 03:22:01,440
Let's have it there.

3645
03:22:15,320 --> 03:22:15,720
Cool.

3646
03:22:16,740 --> 03:22:17,140
Diamonds.

3647
03:22:18,380 --> 03:22:19,200
And a saddle.

3648
03:22:20,400 --> 03:22:21,080
What is this?

3649
03:22:21,460 --> 03:22:21,920
Oh, regeneration.

3650
03:22:22,320 --> 03:22:22,520
Right.

3651
03:22:39,560 --> 03:22:39,960
Shit!

3652
03:22:40,300 --> 03:22:42,200
I don't know where I came from in here now.

3653
03:22:42,300 --> 03:22:42,780
I'm kinda lost.

3654
03:22:45,520 --> 03:22:46,040
Uh oh.

3655
03:22:48,320 --> 03:22:51,480
I'm gonna go back to where I was and then just continue in a straight line.

3656
03:22:53,660 --> 03:22:55,340
SLJ will continue.

3657
03:22:57,060 --> 03:22:57,860
Not that way.

3658
03:22:57,980 --> 03:22:58,520
Not that way.

3659
03:22:58,940 --> 03:22:59,480
This way.

3660
03:23:03,880 --> 03:23:05,160
Did I check this chest?

3661
03:23:29,560 --> 03:23:31,500
See the way the chat just ran across?

3662
03:23:35,460 --> 03:23:36,120
Oh yeah.

3663
03:23:36,300 --> 03:23:37,020
That's what I'm talking about.

3664
03:23:48,090 --> 03:23:48,950
Ain't no biggie.

3665
03:23:51,190 --> 03:23:52,650
I wanna find more skulls.

3666
03:23:56,630 --> 03:23:59,170
I wanna get one of those flowers.

3667
03:24:01,130 --> 03:24:01,970
From the wither.

3668
03:24:04,170 --> 03:24:05,150
I had one...

3669
03:24:05,150 --> 03:24:05,930
Once before.

3670
03:24:06,130 --> 03:24:07,050
And I don't remember what it did.

3671
03:24:07,150 --> 03:24:08,150
So I kinda wanna get one more.

3672
03:24:09,950 --> 03:24:11,190
Uh, let's just go out this way.

3673
03:24:14,880 --> 03:24:15,560
Oh, nice.

3674
03:24:33,270 --> 03:24:33,630
Yeah.

3675
03:24:34,330 --> 03:24:35,650
I've got no idea where I am.

3676
03:24:41,320 --> 03:24:42,360
This is closed off.

3677
03:24:49,420 --> 03:24:49,940
Fuckin' hell.

3678
03:24:51,620 --> 03:24:52,580
Where did I...

3679
03:24:52,580 --> 03:24:53,600
Did I come from here?

3680
03:24:53,780 --> 03:24:54,920
Did I walk up some stairs?

3681
03:24:55,040 --> 03:24:55,280
Probably.

3682
03:24:59,360 --> 03:25:01,720
I think I should just accept that I'm lost in here now.

3683
03:25:02,420 --> 03:25:03,420
Yeah, I've been here a million times.

3684
03:25:07,250 --> 03:25:07,910
Oh, hello!

3685
03:25:28,580 --> 03:25:29,760
I'm gonna mine this.

3686
03:25:37,430 --> 03:25:38,590
Okay, this is more like it.

3687
03:25:39,750 --> 03:25:42,270
Open spaces like this where I can at least see...

3688
03:25:42,950 --> 03:25:43,770
what's going on.

3689
03:25:49,560 --> 03:25:51,080
Oh, we got something different over there.

3690
03:25:51,140 --> 03:25:51,660
Let's go that way.

3691
03:25:59,440 --> 03:26:00,200
Ha, sick!

3692
03:26:01,040 --> 03:26:03,940
The skills on display here are out of control.

