4257
03:56:12,860 --> 03:56:13,680
I need it!

4258
03:56:14,960 --> 03:56:16,240
I'm gonna leave your bell, though.

4259
03:56:18,940 --> 03:56:19,840
Do I have enough?

4260
03:56:20,400 --> 03:56:20,880
Five?

4261
03:56:21,280 --> 03:56:21,600
Eh.

4262
03:56:23,940 --> 03:56:25,140
This is so bad.

4263
03:56:25,580 --> 03:56:27,220
Oh, I could also have stolen it from the house.

4264
03:56:27,640 --> 03:56:29,360
I'm gonna steal some house, okay?

4265
03:56:29,820 --> 03:56:30,580
Don't mind me.

4266
03:56:33,350 --> 03:56:34,270
Oh, is that a furnace?

4267
03:56:34,870 --> 03:56:35,690
Blast furnace!

4268
03:56:36,410 --> 03:56:37,590
Uh, not the one...

4269
03:56:37,590 --> 03:56:38,510
Not the furnace I need, though.

4270
03:56:41,210 --> 03:56:42,650
Do you not have a normal one?

4271
03:56:43,610 --> 03:56:44,050
Oh!

4272
03:56:44,770 --> 03:56:46,710
Oh, he makes iron leggings, though.

4273
03:56:48,730 --> 03:56:49,570
Can't afford it.

4274
03:56:53,080 --> 03:56:53,640
Thank you.

4275
03:56:55,780 --> 03:56:56,640
Okay, furnace.

4276
03:57:02,030 --> 03:57:04,310
Burn some of this, and cook these.

4277
03:57:07,900 --> 03:57:08,640
Yes, sir.

4278
03:57:13,000 --> 03:57:14,840
What happens if I destroy this block, I wonder?

4279
03:57:14,840 --> 03:57:16,780
Is the water just gonna free-flow?

4280
03:57:18,060 --> 03:57:19,220
Oh, that is weird.

4281
03:57:21,820 --> 03:57:22,980
That is so weird.

4282
03:57:26,490 --> 03:57:27,890
We also got some food here.

4283
03:57:44,380 --> 03:57:45,900
I guess I need a crafting table.

4284
03:57:47,540 --> 03:57:48,560
To make the bread.

4285
03:57:50,000 --> 03:57:51,120
Where art thou?

4286
03:57:56,490 --> 03:57:57,690
Did I put it over here?

4287
03:58:02,200 --> 03:58:03,400
Right next to the furnace.

4288
03:58:03,680 --> 03:58:04,740
Whatever that is.

4289
03:58:05,040 --> 03:58:05,560
There.

4290
03:58:08,140 --> 03:58:10,800
In fact, I can always use these houses as fuel.

4291
03:58:13,670 --> 03:58:14,110
Okay.

4292
03:58:14,310 --> 03:58:14,850
Eat this.

4293
03:58:18,800 --> 03:58:19,760
Oh, you know what?

4294
03:58:19,780 --> 03:58:20,480
