4298
03:58:37,570 --> 03:58:38,370
A cave.

4299
03:58:40,050 --> 03:58:41,570
I don't want to go caving, man.

4300
03:58:46,260 --> 03:58:47,160
No, I believe.

4301
03:58:47,340 --> 03:58:48,720
I believe I can do it without a shield.

4302
03:58:55,100 --> 03:58:56,220
Or maybe I shouldn't.

4303
03:59:01,010 --> 03:59:04,270
I'm gonna put some new stuff in here, and then I'm gonna go find a cave.

4304
03:59:05,310 --> 03:59:05,710
Nearby.

4305
03:59:08,410 --> 03:59:09,530
Could also make a new furnace.

4306
03:59:13,430 --> 03:59:13,930
You know what?

4307
03:59:13,950 --> 03:59:14,510
Just do this now.

4308
03:59:15,410 --> 03:59:16,590
Cook that for me, please.

4309
03:59:17,430 --> 03:59:18,150
I'll be back.

4310
03:59:19,770 --> 03:59:20,830
Doesn't that look like a face?

4311
03:59:23,050 --> 03:59:24,250
Mouth, nose, eyes.

4312
03:59:29,050 --> 03:59:29,950
There's a cave over here.

4313
03:59:43,390 --> 03:59:45,490
The only thing is, I can't go too far from home.

4314
03:59:47,250 --> 03:59:47,970
Oh, nice.

4315
03:59:48,570 --> 03:59:49,630
I guess I should kinda need this.

4316
03:59:50,770 --> 03:59:52,190
That would be very nice to have.

4317
03:59:57,800 --> 03:59:59,180
I will plant a tree down here.

4318
03:59:59,420 --> 04:00:00,140
Oh, I can't.

4319
04:00:10,450 --> 04:00:11,650
No more podcasting.

4320
04:00:12,950 --> 04:00:14,710
Let's see if we can't find some iron.

4321
04:00:18,070 --> 04:00:19,270
Nah, it's all flooded here.

4322
04:00:19,410 --> 04:00:19,930
This is bad.

4323
04:00:22,590 --> 04:00:22,990
Tree.

4324
04:00:27,820 --> 04:00:29,140
Oh, that looks enticing.

4325
04:00:49,240 --> 04:00:50,880
Oh yeah, there's bound to be some iron here.

4326
04:01:13,280 --> 04:01:13,940
Come up here.

4327
04:01:27,220 --> 04:01:27,660
What?

4328
04:01:27,880 --> 04:01:28,780
