4330
04:01:35,020 --> 04:01:35,780
Okay, okay.

4331
04:01:38,120 --> 04:01:39,640
I'm just pushing him down further.

4332
04:01:39,780 --> 04:01:40,420
I don't know about that.

4333
04:01:43,200 --> 04:01:44,180
Okay, there he is.

4334
04:01:52,540 --> 04:01:53,640
Not bad, not bad.

4335
04:01:55,000 --> 04:01:55,720
