4340
04:02:10,380 --> 04:02:11,840
With a stone pig axe?

4341
04:02:12,620 --> 04:02:13,600
That's crazy.

4342
04:02:19,510 --> 04:02:20,230
Fucking hell.

4343
04:02:20,310 --> 04:02:21,770
I was sure there would be iron here.

4344
04:02:23,070 --> 04:02:25,090
I mean, I am kind of deep.

4345
04:02:25,890 --> 04:02:28,390
This may be a good depth to find iron, you know?

4346
04:02:28,710 --> 04:02:29,730
Let's go a little bit.

4347
04:02:32,850 --> 04:02:33,870
Oh, lucky.

4348
04:02:39,050 --> 04:02:39,990
There we go.

4349
04:02:42,630 --> 04:02:43,370
Lucky me.

4350
04:02:50,630 --> 04:02:51,110
Oh.

4351
04:02:52,970 --> 04:02:53,710
Even more.

4352
04:02:57,580 --> 04:02:58,960
Let me grab just the...

4353
04:02:58,960 --> 04:02:59,440
Oh, you know what?

4354
04:03:00,000 --> 04:03:01,080
Grab a bit of this as well.

4355
04:03:01,800 --> 04:03:02,740
Can I even mine this?

4356
04:03:03,540 --> 04:03:04,500
I can't.

4357
04:03:04,640 --> 04:03:04,940
Okay.

4358
04:03:05,600 --> 04:03:06,080
Well.

4359
04:03:06,860 --> 04:03:08,100
I see a bit more iron.

4360
04:03:08,680 --> 04:03:10,440
Can I get it without aggravating that guy?

4361
04:03:10,920 --> 04:03:11,900
Maybe if I sneak.

4362
04:03:25,360 --> 04:03:25,840
No!

4363
04:03:47,860 --> 04:03:48,740
There we go.

4364
04:03:50,280 --> 04:03:51,320
Oh, even more.

4365
04:03:52,540 --> 04:03:54,320
Fortune smiles upon me, my friend.

4366
04:04:09,760 --> 04:04:10,380
Very good.

4367
04:04:11,280 --> 04:04:13,980
I think I have enough to get something good started here.

4368
04:04:15,340 --> 04:04:18,540
Maybe even a bit of armor on top of it all.

4369
04:04:19,820 --> 04:04:20,580
Could be neat.

4370
04:04:21,320 --> 04:04:21,580
Yeah.

4371
04:04:21,980 --> 04:04:22,780
This is a good start.

4372
04:04:24,780 --> 04:04:26,140
I don't really need more than this.

4373
04:04:27,780 --> 04:04:28,840
This is totally cool.

4374
04:04:32,460 --> 04:04:37,700
As long as I have a shield and I have ascension blocks with me, I can pretty much make anything happen.

4375
04:04:39,080 --> 04:04:40,260
Use the terrain to my advantage.

4376
04:04:40,380 --> 04:04:42,520
That's going to be the name of the game in this recovery mission.

4377
04:04:48,130 --> 04:04:51,470
Anytime there's combat, I'm just going to block off the terrain and be like, Nope.

4378
04:04:51,690 --> 04:04:52,290
Not today, sir.

4379
04:05:02,940 --> 04:05:04,660
Oh, it looked like he was walking backwards.

4380
04:05:05,580 --> 04:05:07,420
My eyes are deceiving me today, man.

4381
04:05:08,760 --> 04:05:12,380
This horse is apparently having the same thought that I had.

4382
04:05:12,580 --> 04:05:13,780
He wants to go get some iron.

4383
04:05:14,740 --> 04:05:15,200
You know what?

4384
04:05:15,260 --> 04:05:15,700
No, thank you.

4385
04:05:15,700 --> 04:05:16,240
I'm going to go to sleep.

4386
04:05:17,860 --> 04:05:18,220
No!

4387
04:05:19,040 --> 04:05:20,040
Get out of your bed.

4388
04:05:20,380 --> 04:05:20,740
Shit.

4389
04:05:22,060 --> 04:05:23,060
Let me have the other bed.

4390
04:05:24,620 --> 04:05:25,400
Out, out, out, out.

4391
04:05:25,700 --> 04:05:26,020
Nice.

4392
04:05:30,720 --> 04:05:31,380
There we go.

4393
04:05:32,460 --> 04:05:32,820
Ah!

4394
04:05:33,040 --> 04:05:33,720
Get out of here.

4395
04:05:36,920 --> 04:05:37,280
Okay.

4396
04:05:38,760 --> 04:05:40,140
Now we go collect our food.

4397
04:05:44,780 --> 04:05:46,040
Oh, I didn't have enough fuel.

4398
04:05:46,420 --> 04:05:49,400
And I used all of my coal for...

4399
04:05:51,570 --> 04:05:52,330
Mistakes were made.

4400
04:05:52,330 --> 04:05:53,410
Can I burn this?

4401
04:05:54,170 --> 04:05:54,770
No?

4402
04:05:57,590 --> 04:05:58,210
Ah...

4403
04:05:59,170 --> 04:05:59,790
Well.

4404
04:06:02,780 --> 04:06:05,160
I'm slowly burning this village.

4405
04:06:05,400 --> 04:06:07,380
Okay, that's kind of...

4406
04:06:07,380 --> 04:06:08,520
Annoying.

4407
04:06:11,020 --> 04:06:15,920
This village is a mere sacrifice for me to make my recovery mission.

4408
04:06:16,520 --> 04:06:19,860
They will have to bow down to me and offer up all their goods.

4409
04:06:21,260 --> 04:06:22,760
Let's turn these into planks first.

4410
04:06:25,040 --> 04:06:25,740
There we go.

4411
04:06:26,080 --> 04:06:26,840
Leave some of them here.

4412
04:06:28,520 --> 04:06:29,620
Now we're cooking that.

4413
04:06:30,940 --> 04:06:31,380
Okay.

4414
04:06:32,280 --> 04:06:33,180
And you know what?

4415
04:06:33,280 --> 04:06:34,280
I'm going to make another furnace.

4416
04:06:35,980 --> 04:06:36,900
Oh, can I even?

4417
04:06:37,780 --> 04:06:39,140
Don't have enough cobblestone.

4418
04:06:42,310 --> 04:06:43,250
This will do nicely.

4419
04:06:46,670 --> 04:06:50,790
You guys are going to have to go a little cold during the winter, but, you know, it is what it is.

4420
04:06:52,170 --> 04:06:54,430
I promise you, I will reimburse you in the future.

4421
04:06:56,210 --> 04:06:57,090
At some point.

4422
04:06:58,250 --> 04:06:58,850
Unspecified date.

4423
04:07:00,930 --> 04:07:01,290
Right.

4424
04:07:01,490 --> 04:07:01,850
Furnace.

4425
04:07:02,650 --> 04:07:04,210
Because I also want to cook some iron.

4426
04:07:04,750 --> 04:07:05,330
Oh, but wait a minute!

4427
04:07:05,330 --> 04:07:06,350
Blast furnace in here!

4428
04:07:07,170 --> 04:07:08,610
We can blast that shit!

4429
04:07:10,750 --> 04:07:11,550
Hell yeah!

4430
04:07:12,490 --> 04:07:13,590
That's what I'm talking about.

4431
04:07:14,850 --> 04:07:15,630
But you know what?

4432
04:07:15,690 --> 04:07:17,210
I will also make use of the other furnace.

4433
04:07:18,690 --> 04:07:20,110
That I was gonna make.

4434
04:07:24,230 --> 04:07:25,910
We're gonna put in some...

4435
04:07:25,910 --> 04:07:27,270
I guess half of this.

4436
04:07:28,350 --> 04:07:29,250
There we go.

4437
04:07:29,530 --> 04:07:31,050
And we're gonna cook the other meats.

4438
04:07:32,650 --> 04:07:33,130
Nice.

4439
04:07:33,630 --> 04:07:34,590
Now we're cooking.

4440
04:07:36,470 --> 04:07:38,510
How fast is this consuming fuel?

4441
04:07:40,550 --> 04:07:41,350
Decently fast.

4442
04:07:41,550 --> 04:07:42,530
But it's also cooking fast.

4443
04:07:43,050 --> 04:07:43,570
So...

4444
04:07:43,570 --> 04:07:44,410
Not bad.

4445
04:07:46,110 --> 04:07:46,630
Alright.

4446
04:07:46,670 --> 04:07:48,690
I will now reimburse you for what I've taken.

4447
04:07:49,130 --> 04:07:49,310
There.

4448
04:07:49,450 --> 04:07:49,730
Flower.

4449
04:07:51,890 --> 04:07:58,390
When that flower one day withers and dies, then you will know I will come back here and reimburse this village.

4450
04:07:59,190 --> 04:08:03,890
Every stolen plank, every stolen piece of iron and everything else in between.

4451
04:08:04,590 --> 04:08:05,330
Will be returned.

4452
04:08:07,510 --> 04:08:08,570
Actually, I need some of this wood.

4453
04:08:10,530 --> 04:08:11,010
Shield.

4454
04:08:11,590 --> 04:08:12,650
There we go.

4455
04:08:13,350 --> 04:08:15,110
And then with the remaining...

4456
04:08:17,350 --> 04:08:18,430
I can make some armor.

4457
04:08:22,180 --> 04:08:23,260
What is most important?

4458
04:08:23,500 --> 04:08:24,600
Probably the chest, right?

4459
04:08:24,680 --> 04:08:25,280
Six armor.

4460
04:08:28,560 --> 04:08:29,660
Yeah, it's a good one.

4461
04:08:31,160 --> 04:08:32,080
Put that on.

4462
04:08:32,600 --> 04:08:33,660
Grab that food.

4463
04:08:33,940 --> 04:08:34,720
Cook this one now.

4464
04:08:40,820 --> 04:08:42,140
I don't think we need more than...

4465
04:08:42,140 --> 04:08:42,640
Yeah, good.

4466
04:08:43,300 --> 04:08:44,000
Good stuff.

4467
04:08:46,200 --> 04:08:47,040
What can I make?

4468
04:08:47,320 --> 04:08:48,040
I can make legs.

4469
04:08:48,160 --> 04:08:48,560
Let's do that.

4470
04:08:50,420 --> 04:08:51,340
Can I make more?

4471
04:08:52,700 --> 04:08:53,540
With my current?

4472
04:08:53,720 --> 04:08:54,540
Ooh, right!

4473
04:08:55,880 --> 04:08:57,320
Should probably do that, huh?

4474
04:08:58,940 --> 04:08:59,700
Better weapons.

4475
04:09:00,000 --> 04:09:00,560
Kind of important.

4476
04:09:01,780 --> 04:09:02,500
In the nether.

4477
04:09:04,980 --> 04:09:07,260
And I'm thinking maybe also a better pickaxe.

4478
04:09:11,310 --> 04:09:13,670
We're gonna have to go down one more time and find some iron.

4479
04:09:22,220 --> 04:09:24,800
It's kind of reassuring to know that my items won't disappear.

4480
04:09:26,200 --> 04:09:27,740
Because I am not near them right now.

4481
04:09:27,840 --> 04:09:28,520
They're not being loaded.

4482
04:09:30,940 --> 04:09:31,860
Was this the way I went?

4483
04:09:31,960 --> 04:09:32,520
It was.

4484
04:09:35,510 --> 04:09:36,490
Let's equip these torches.

4485
04:09:42,040 --> 04:09:44,500
I'm just hitting my head on every rock in here.

4486
04:09:44,660 --> 04:09:45,760
Ow, ow, ow, ow.

4487
04:09:53,520 --> 04:09:54,340
Now I'm not afraid.

4488
04:09:54,680 --> 04:09:56,800
Now I can go deeper with my shield and my armor.

4489
04:09:58,480 --> 04:10:00,000
I can grab a little bit more over here.

4490
04:10:00,080 --> 04:10:00,740
Can I grab this now?

4491
04:10:02,620 --> 04:10:03,660
Ooh, it doesn't look like it.

4492
04:10:03,820 --> 04:10:04,040
Oh, wait.

4493
04:10:04,080 --> 04:10:05,400
This is still a stone pickaxe, of course.

4494
04:10:06,040 --> 04:10:06,960
It's not iron yet.

4495
04:10:19,410 --> 04:10:20,050
No way.

4496
04:10:21,070 --> 04:10:22,610
Is this what I think it is?

4497
04:10:24,070 --> 04:10:24,510
Hello!

4498
04:10:25,270 --> 04:10:25,830
There's sky...

4499
04:10:25,830 --> 04:10:26,930
These things are fucking everywhere.

4500
04:10:28,170 --> 04:10:28,610
Lovely.

4501
04:10:29,630 --> 04:10:31,230
I could do that, I guess.

4502
04:10:32,330 --> 04:10:35,490
There's bound to be some nice items in here that can aid me in my quest.

4503
04:10:37,470 --> 04:10:39,130
Let me actually find some iron for...

4504
04:10:39,130 --> 04:10:40,010
Oh, I see iron up there.

4505
04:10:47,410 --> 04:10:47,850
Diamond!

4506
04:10:49,210 --> 04:10:49,650
Hello!

4507
04:10:52,980 --> 04:10:54,500
Brother, at this...

4508
04:10:54,500 --> 04:10:55,200
depth?

4509
04:10:55,420 --> 04:10:57,080
I feel like I'm not that far down.

4510
04:10:59,360 --> 04:11:00,140
That is awesome!

4511
04:11:07,360 --> 04:11:08,940
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

4512
04:11:09,620 --> 04:11:10,780
I can't do that with stone.

4513
04:11:12,160 --> 04:11:13,060
Hold up a second.

4514
04:11:13,740 --> 04:11:14,760
I can't do that with stone.

4515
04:11:15,260 --> 04:11:16,580
I need iron for that.

4516
04:11:21,230 --> 04:11:22,030
How much do I have?

4517
04:11:22,870 --> 04:11:23,490
One piece.

4518
04:11:23,670 --> 04:11:24,750
Oh, that's not good enough.

4519
04:11:25,650 --> 04:11:26,890
That is not good enough.

4520
04:11:28,630 --> 04:11:29,950
I kind of want to go rob this place?

4521
04:11:29,990 --> 04:11:30,590
Is that crazy?

4522
04:11:31,010 --> 04:11:33,710
But there's also crazy enemies in there, so maybe I shouldn't do that yet.

4523
04:11:36,590 --> 04:11:37,350
That comes later.

4524
04:11:37,990 --> 04:11:39,410
Ah, fuck, I gotta go this way, actually.

4525
04:11:40,210 --> 04:11:41,170
Yeah, let's check out what's over here.

4526
04:11:42,710 --> 04:11:43,470
There's gotta be some iron.

4527
04:11:46,310 --> 04:11:46,590
Maybe.

4528
04:11:53,150 --> 04:11:53,710
Oh, god.

4529
04:11:55,470 --> 04:11:55,870
Wow.

4530
04:11:57,950 --> 04:11:58,350
Asshole.

4531
04:12:04,060 --> 04:12:04,460
Nice.

4532
04:12:08,900 --> 04:12:10,080
Let's put this on the right.

4533
04:12:18,270 --> 04:12:18,910
Good enough.

4534
04:12:30,560 --> 04:12:32,440
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

4535
04:12:34,620 --> 04:12:35,780
Oh, now we're cooking.

4536
04:12:36,200 --> 04:12:36,900
Oh, yes.

4537
04:12:37,180 --> 04:12:38,080
That's a lot, too.

4538
04:12:38,140 --> 04:12:38,740
