4547
04:13:31,000 --> 04:13:31,720
I'm just going to keep mining.

4548
04:13:53,660 --> 04:13:55,620
All right, that's good.

4549
04:13:55,740 --> 04:13:56,000
That's good.

4550
04:13:56,240 --> 04:13:56,860
No more.

4551
