You know, maybe this is a good place for a forward base of operations.

4564
04:15:22,160 --> 04:15:25,320
Where I can plan my recovery mission, you know?

4565
04:15:25,820 --> 04:15:28,060
We're right next to this trial chamber.

4566
04:15:29,160 --> 04:15:30,960
And there's a cave right underneath us.

4567
04:15:31,260 --> 04:15:32,400
In case we need anything.

4568
04:15:33,180 --> 04:15:35,640
This is where we will plan our approach.

4569
04:15:36,720 --> 04:15:39,480
To get back and recover what was lost.

4570
04:15:39,920 --> 04:15:42,320
And get revenge on the damn pigs.

4571
04:15:48,820 --> 04:15:50,920
Forward base of operations right here.

4572
04:16:00,670 --> 04:16:02,850
Next time, it's all about recovery.

4573
04:16:03,510 --> 04:16:04,750
This time we went far.

4574
04:16:05,550 --> 04:16:06,370
F-A-R.

4575
04:16:06,590 --> 04:16:07,410
But let me be honest.

4576
04:16:08,770 --> 04:16:09,950
Maybe we went too far.

4577
04:16:11,490 --> 04:16:11,890
Yeah.

4578
04:16:12,450 --> 04:16:13,490
Too far it is.

4579
04:16:13,930 --> 04:16:15,970
And we got to rectify that in the next one.

4580
04:16:17,750 --> 04:16:20,570
But I think I set myself up ready to go back.

4581
04:16:20,590 --> 04:16:22,130
And I think I know the way back, by the way.

4582
04:16:22,330 --> 04:16:23,970
I kind of remember the path I took.

4583
04:16:23,970 --> 04:16:25,050
So it shouldn't be too difficult.

4584
04:16:26,570 --> 04:16:27,990
Put that cookie down!

4585
04:16:29,010 --> 04:16:30,790
I can't do the Schwarzenegger voice.

4586
04:16:34,010 --> 04:16:34,750
Hold on.

4587
04:16:35,470 --> 04:16:37,550
Let me quickly do a transition there.

4588
04:16:38,810 --> 04:16:39,650
Very nice.

4589
04:16:46,980 --> 04:16:47,760
Oh yeah!

4590
04:16:48,700 --> 04:16:50,120
That was a good session though.

4591
04:16:51,280 --> 04:16:52,360
Discovered a lot of stuff.

4592
04:16:53,900 --> 04:16:55,800
Honestly, all in all, I'm happy with it.

4593
04:16:56,760 --> 04:16:57,660
Despite the ending.

4594
04:16:58,260 --> 04:16:58,960
Me dying.

4595
04:16:59,140 --> 04:16:59,740
You know, that sucks.

4596
04:16:59,900 --> 04:17:00,640
But it's part of the game.

4597
04:17:01,680 --> 04:17:02,560
I had fun, man.

4598
04:17:07,460 --> 04:17:08,520
A lot happened today.

4599
04:17:08,680 --> 04:17:09,320
Yeah, you're right.

4600
04:17:10,880 --> 04:17:12,360
Guys, I'm looking at chat right now.

4601
04:17:16,900 --> 04:17:18,440
He's looking at cheat right now?

4602
04:17:18,560 --> 04:17:19,100
No, I'm not.

4603
04:17:19,280 --> 04:17:20,260
I would never cheat.

4604
04:17:23,740 --> 04:17:26,460
This felt like a callback from the Season 1's Big W arc.

4605
04:17:27,180 --> 04:17:28,900
That's gotta be the worst death I ever had.

4606
04:17:28,900 --> 04:17:34,860
Where I died to Big W and I got sent back to another bed like a thousand miles away.

4607
04:17:36,080 --> 04:17:39,040
This one is not as bad, but it's definitely bad, you know?

4608
04:17:39,720 --> 04:17:40,600
I've had worse.

4609
04:17:40,680 --> 04:17:41,320
Let me just say that.

4610
04:17:41,780 --> 04:17:43,300
This is definitely not the worst I've been.

4611
04:17:47,850 --> 04:17:49,230
World Seed is pretty...

4612
04:17:49,230 --> 04:17:50,030
By the way.

4613
04:17:50,150 --> 04:17:51,690
Insane Endless Winter Wonderland.

4614
04:17:51,830 --> 04:17:52,070
Right?

4615
04:17:52,350 --> 04:17:53,410
So it wasn't just me.

4616
04:17:53,530 --> 04:17:55,350
That is a big-ass area.

4617
04:17:56,710 --> 04:17:57,690
That is not normal.

4618
04:17:57,830 --> 04:17:59,110
I feel like that was special.

4619
04:18:08,580 --> 04:18:09,800
I kind of want to turn this up a bit.

4620
04:18:10,820 --> 04:18:15,740
Man, this soundtrack right here has been on my mind ever since I played Silent Hill 2.

4621
04:18:16,960 --> 04:18:19,520
That fucking game is a masterpiece.

4622
04:18:20,320 --> 04:18:21,560
Can't stop thinking about it.

4623
04:18:25,510 --> 04:18:26,250
Let me see here.

4624
04:18:26,330 --> 04:18:26,510
There?

4625
04:18:26,730 --> 04:18:27,090
Okay.

4626
04:18:27,530 --> 04:18:28,670
I feel like I'm being watched.

4627
04:18:28,790 --> 04:18:29,110
You are!

4628
04:18:29,210 --> 04:18:30,590
I'm watching you right now.

4629
04:18:32,250 --> 04:18:33,170
I see you.

4630
04:18:38,840 --> 04:18:42,020
Also, the pot not having a special texture was indeed a bug.

4631
04:18:42,260 --> 04:18:43,200
Oh, it was!

4632
04:18:44,760 --> 04:18:47,700
You mean the pottery shirt thing, right?

4633
04:18:48,920 --> 04:18:51,180
Because I could have sworn that felt like a bug.

4634
04:18:53,940 --> 04:18:54,500
Oh, wait.

4635
04:18:54,700 --> 04:18:54,780
What?

4636
04:18:54,840 --> 04:18:55,500
Was it not a bug?

4637
04:18:56,400 --> 04:18:56,680
Or...

4638
04:18:57,100 --> 04:18:57,840
Oh, it was a bug.

4639
04:18:57,960 --> 04:18:58,120
Okay.

4640
04:18:58,640 --> 04:18:58,920
Good.

4641
04:19:00,480 --> 04:19:02,500
Yeah, I've been looking at chat the entire stream, guys.

4642
04:19:04,960 --> 04:19:09,840
In fact, this entire stream was pre-recorded and I've just been sitting here reading chat live.

4643
04:19:18,410 --> 04:19:20,670
What would you recommend for my floor tiles, Oliver?

4644
04:19:20,790 --> 04:19:21,710
I need new floor tiles.

4645
04:19:22,530 --> 04:19:24,890
Do you mean in Minecraft or in the real world?

4646
04:19:25,050 --> 04:19:26,850
Because if it's the real world, then I don't know.

4647
04:19:27,370 --> 04:19:27,770
But!

4648
04:19:27,910 --> 04:19:29,770
If it's Minecraft, then I don't know.

4649
04:19:31,230 --> 04:19:31,930
I'm sorry.

4650
04:19:33,210 --> 04:19:34,210
I can't help you.

4651
04:19:34,450 --> 04:19:34,770
I don't...

4652
04:19:34,770 --> 04:19:35,250
Nope.

4653
04:19:35,470 --> 04:19:35,990
I don't know.

4654
04:19:39,270 --> 04:19:41,810
When you asked us what direction, nobody said south.

4655
04:19:41,890 --> 04:19:42,970
We said everything but south.

4656
04:19:43,190 --> 04:19:43,510
Wait, really?

4657
04:19:44,810 --> 04:19:45,250
Why?

4658
04:19:47,050 --> 04:19:50,690
Oh, is it because you somehow knew that I would end up dying this way if I went south?

4659
04:19:50,710 --> 04:19:51,710
It's like a premonition.

4660
04:19:51,830 --> 04:19:52,830
You knew what was going to happen.

4661
04:19:54,870 --> 04:19:57,510
Oh, the XDXXS for 40 floor tiles.

4662
04:19:58,310 --> 04:19:59,950
I wouldn't recommend those, honestly.

4663
04:20:00,870 --> 04:20:04,110
Unless you're into aggregates.

4664
04:20:06,350 --> 04:20:08,110
Polish diorite slabs for flooring.

4665
04:20:08,990 --> 04:20:09,650
You should.

4666
04:20:09,790 --> 04:20:10,070
Use it.

4667
04:20:13,200 --> 04:20:16,280
Even though you ultimately died, you did very good ignoring all those caves.

4668
04:20:16,440 --> 04:20:16,700
I'm proud.

4669
04:20:16,840 --> 04:20:17,780
Hey, thank you.

4670
04:20:19,640 --> 04:20:21,240
It was tempting to go into them.

4671
04:20:21,380 --> 04:20:22,200
I'm not going to lie.

4672
04:20:22,340 --> 04:20:24,820
But I really wanted to go far this time.

4673
04:20:25,700 --> 04:20:27,200
Just completely new place.

4674
04:20:27,400 --> 04:20:27,840
New area.

4675
04:20:28,680 --> 04:20:29,640
New adventure.

4676
04:20:33,660 --> 04:20:35,300
There was almost 200 viewers.

4677
04:20:35,480 --> 04:20:36,120
That's crazy.

4678
04:20:38,300 --> 04:20:39,200
Why is that?

4679
04:20:39,900 --> 04:20:41,720
Why are there 200 viewers this time?

4680
04:20:41,840 --> 04:20:44,440
This wasn't even planned, this stream.

4681
04:20:44,560 --> 04:20:46,120
It wasn't even scheduled in the events.

4682
04:20:46,800 --> 04:20:49,780
It was sort of a surprise dream, I guess.

4683
04:20:52,980 --> 04:20:54,020
Maybe just RNG.

4684
04:20:54,480 --> 04:20:55,620
It's a Monday, too.

4685
04:20:56,460 --> 04:20:58,180
Maybe people are having the Mondays.

4686
04:20:58,480 --> 04:20:59,680
Suffering from the Mondays.

4687
04:21:00,640 --> 04:21:01,780
And are browsing Twitch.

4688
04:21:06,570 --> 04:21:11,270
Can you give us your insight into your thought process when you said, fuck it, let's keep exploring the Bastion?

4689
04:21:11,450 --> 04:21:15,130
My thought process was, I don't have a bet on me.

4690
04:21:16,370 --> 04:21:16,950
Fuck it.

4691
04:21:17,230 --> 04:21:18,830
Let's keep exploring the Bastion.

4692
04:21:19,370 --> 04:21:20,730
That's the extent of it.

4693
04:21:21,470 --> 04:21:22,390
That's what I thought.

4694
04:21:22,670 --> 04:21:23,470
And you know what?

4695
04:21:23,490 --> 04:21:24,670
At the time, it sounded good.

4696
04:21:25,030 --> 04:21:26,150
And let me tell you this.

4697
04:21:26,790 --> 04:21:30,890
If it had ended up with me conquering the Bastion, that would have been a great choice.

4698
04:21:31,830 --> 04:21:32,370
You know?

4699
04:21:32,510 --> 04:21:33,530
But it didn't happen.

4700
04:21:33,730 --> 04:21:35,410
And sometimes, shit happens.

4701
04:21:37,250 --> 04:21:40,210
You gotta be brave sometimes, you know?

4702
04:21:43,750 --> 04:21:45,050
Supercut may have brought some people.

4703
04:21:45,110 --> 04:21:45,830
That's true, yeah.

4704
04:21:45,930 --> 04:21:48,930
Elis has made like three parts of that now.

4705
04:21:51,670 --> 04:21:53,230
And they're like two hours each.

4706
04:21:53,430 --> 04:21:55,510
That's six hours still.

4707
04:21:55,670 --> 04:21:57,430
That's a long thing to watch, right?

4708
04:21:58,310 --> 04:21:59,510
For a supercut, I mean.

4709
04:22:00,810 --> 04:22:02,090
Why didn't you just dig out?

4710
04:22:05,090 --> 04:22:08,590
I think I was panicking when the guy came at me and I was in melee with him.

4711
04:22:09,550 --> 04:22:10,430
I think I was...

4712
04:22:10,430 --> 04:22:11,430
I think I knew it was over.

4713
04:22:11,890 --> 04:22:13,390
Because I couldn't block for some reason.

4714
04:22:16,960 --> 04:22:18,680
Oh, the revenge arc is real.

4715
04:22:18,840 --> 04:22:19,440
Lost in Arts.

4716
04:22:20,080 --> 04:22:21,540
I'll be back for that guy.

4717
04:22:22,180 --> 04:22:23,640
And I'm gonna skin him alive.

4718
04:22:23,800 --> 04:22:25,500
I'll poke out his eyes and boil him in oil.

4719
04:22:32,660 --> 04:22:33,760
Oh, dig out of the cave.

4720
04:22:33,860 --> 04:22:34,540
Wait, which cave?

4721
04:22:35,940 --> 04:22:38,240
Oh, you mean the cave where I made the portal?

4722
04:22:40,020 --> 04:22:40,460
Laziness?

4723
04:22:42,220 --> 04:22:42,660
Hubris?

4724
04:22:43,020 --> 04:22:43,460
Probably?

4725
04:22:45,860 --> 04:22:47,860
You know, I haven't died in a million years.

4726
04:22:47,860 --> 04:22:49,020
I thought I could never die.

4727
04:22:52,640 --> 04:22:53,880
I thought I was invincible.

4728
04:22:53,880 --> 04:22:54,640
What can I say?

4729
04:22:57,360 --> 04:22:59,140
I definitely paid for that one.

4730
04:23:01,360 --> 04:23:03,040
I mean, you know...

4731
04:23:03,040 --> 04:23:06,960
I think I knew somewhere in my heart that it was a bad idea.

4732
04:23:07,680 --> 04:23:12,180
But sometimes you make bad ideas on purpose because you're too lazy to do the other thing, right?

4733
04:23:16,970 --> 04:23:19,230
When you said, I don't need this shield, I almost died.

4734
04:23:19,510 --> 04:23:19,890
Oh, yeah.

4735
04:23:20,110 --> 04:23:21,810
I changed my mind about that later, though.

4736
04:23:22,310 --> 04:23:26,250
I really did think at the moment that I didn't need it because I took almost no damage at the time.

4737
04:23:26,350 --> 04:23:27,150
I had such good gear.

4738
04:23:28,010 --> 04:23:33,150
I really thought I was almost invincible and the only way I would die is if I fell into lava with no lava protection.

4739
04:23:33,830 --> 04:23:34,830
Or something like it.

4740
04:23:37,310 --> 04:23:38,250
Also, content.

4741
04:23:39,510 --> 04:23:40,390
I guess so.

4742
04:23:41,830 --> 04:23:43,930
I think you just underestimated the black pigs.

4743
04:23:44,050 --> 04:23:44,710
I always do!

4744
04:23:45,350 --> 04:23:46,850
These guys are crazy.

4745
04:23:47,390 --> 04:23:48,430
Here's what's gonna happen.

4746
04:23:49,310 --> 04:23:50,750
I'm gonna get my netherite armor.

4747
04:23:51,950 --> 04:23:55,150
And then I'm gonna come back there and I will kill them all.

4748
04:23:55,370 --> 04:23:58,350
Just like the sand people in Star Wars and Anakin.

4749
04:23:59,030 --> 04:24:00,010
That's gonna be me.

4750
04:24:00,970 --> 04:24:03,170
Lightsaber comes on and I'm going to town.

4751
04:24:10,000 --> 04:24:10,440
Whoa!

4752
04:24:11,020 --> 04:24:12,100
An anonymous gifter.

4753
04:24:12,840 --> 04:24:14,100
Five subs to the community.

4754
04:24:14,280 --> 04:24:14,740
Thank you, man.

4755
04:24:15,120 --> 04:24:15,880
Whoever you are.

4756
04:24:16,000 --> 04:24:16,720
I appreciate it.

4757
04:24:20,350 --> 04:24:22,010
And thank you to everyone else subscribing.

4758
04:24:22,630 --> 04:24:23,790
There's a lot of you, man.

4759
04:24:25,050 --> 04:24:32,070
Chicken Liver Nuts, WordRC, Inori Cookie, Aqua Relic, Komashi, and Dolvik.

4760
04:24:32,270 --> 04:24:34,530
I don't really come here often, but thank you for being you, Oliver.

4761
04:24:34,930 --> 04:24:36,050
Thank you for checking it out.

4762
04:24:38,270 --> 04:24:39,150
And someone...

4763
04:24:39,150 --> 04:24:41,310
Sub saying, Help!

4764
04:24:41,670 --> 04:24:42,370
Help me!

4765
04:24:42,690 --> 04:24:43,250
Help everyone!

4766
04:24:43,310 --> 04:24:43,970
Somebody help me!

4767
04:24:44,470 --> 04:24:45,430
Are you okay, Ivory?

4768
04:24:46,590 --> 04:24:48,330
Do you need me to send someone over there?

4769
04:24:55,200 --> 04:24:56,540
Any plans for next stream?

4770
04:24:56,660 --> 04:24:56,840
Yeah!

4771
04:24:57,440 --> 04:24:59,320
We're gonna go back and get the gear.

4772
04:25:01,860 --> 04:25:03,200
We're gonna plan our approach.

4773
04:25:03,560 --> 04:25:04,700
In fact, I have a...

4774
04:25:04,700 --> 04:25:07,340
I'm gonna find a stick, and I'm gonna draw my battle plans in the sand.

4775
04:25:08,560 --> 04:25:10,380
And I'll show you exactly what I have in mind.

4776
04:25:10,880 --> 04:25:13,700
I'm gonna show you the approach angle, how I'm intending to go.

4777
04:25:15,140 --> 04:25:15,940
It's gonna be great.

4778
04:25:17,620 --> 04:25:19,960
We're gonna have, uh...

4779
04:25:19,960 --> 04:25:21,780
Mission Impossible music playing.

4780
04:25:24,640 --> 04:25:28,500
Oliver, you are the most frustrating person to watch play this game, but I can't stop.

4781
04:25:29,080 --> 04:25:29,820
I love it.

4782
04:25:30,660 --> 04:25:31,360
Thank you, man.

4783
04:25:35,110 --> 04:25:36,970
Please bring potatoes when you get revenge.

4784
04:25:37,130 --> 04:25:37,490
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

4785
04:25:37,730 --> 04:25:38,690
That's what I do usually.

4786
04:25:38,690 --> 04:25:40,070
I kill my victims, right?

4787
04:25:40,410 --> 04:25:43,730
And then I slice the potatoes, and put the potato slices on their eyes.

4788
04:25:45,190 --> 04:25:46,370
That's my signature move.

4789
04:25:50,840 --> 04:25:52,940
Oliver, why you think the zombie villager didn't work?

4790
04:25:53,040 --> 04:25:55,460
I think it's because I didn't break the, uh...

4791
04:25:55,460 --> 04:26:01,220
To be honest, I think I should have broken the bar before I threw the, uh, poison thing at him.

4792
04:26:01,320 --> 04:26:02,120
Or the weakening thing.

4793
04:26:02,840 --> 04:26:04,040
But don't tell me, of course.

4794
04:26:04,140 --> 04:26:05,380
